
The goal of the Distributed Compute Automata standard is to create infrastructure for logic and privacy computations.
This is going to be achieved through the use of both software approaches and hardware approaches. The infrastructure comes with no batteries included and these sections
can be as opinionated as needed, if you want to run your network with a software approach where you are purely using say Homomorphic Encryption then these implementations can be
provided.

The common denominator with all implementations will be that there is only as single VM that will run on the user-space nodes. Running a node should be as simple 
as running a browser extension or running a desktop or mobile application.

